<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 237 AND 79-2 V SOUTH AFRICA'S 177.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 237 AND 79-2 V SOUTH AFRICA'S 177.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 79 for two wickets in the second innings at lunch on the third day of their third and final cricket test against South Africa on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 and 79-2 (Kumble 41 not out, S.Ganguly 15 not out); South Africa 177.</p>
